### Balances in the trip base currency + fewest transfers ("Supaya lunas")
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Shared expense: payer and every split user must be members of the trip
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555551",
  "amountMinor": 100000,
  "currency": "IDR",
  "spentAt": "2026-11-20T05:00:00Z",
  "paidByUserId": "paste member id",
  "splits": [
    { "userId": "paste member id", "shareMinor": 50000 },
    { "userId": "paste other member id", "shareMinor": 50000 }
  ]
}

### Mark as settled (any member). Amount in the trip base currency
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/settlements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": "66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666661", "fromUserId": "paste id", "toUserId": "paste id", "amountMinor": 50000 }

### Settlements, newest first
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
